{"question_id": "c1e2da34-f9b6-4709-b904-0cbc63a836a0", "question": "我的皮肤是重度敏感肌,玫瑰痤疮患者,两颊常年泛红,对多种化学防晒剂,甚至某些物理防晒的乳化剂都会产生刺痛和灼热感。我急需一款为我量身定做的纯物理防晒:1) 成分必须只有氧化锌和/或二氧化钛,不含任何化学防晒剂,且整体配方极简,无香精、酒精、精油、尼泊金酯类防腐剂;2) 肤感上,不能假白严重(氧化锌颗粒需处理得好),不能拔干也不能油腻,最好带一点自然润色,能中和我的红血丝;3) 需要便于清洗,普通氨基酸洁面可卸,避免卸妆二次刺激;4) 防晒力需足够日常通勤(SPF30-50, PA+++以上)。请问有我能用的防晒吗?", "expected_product_names": ["CeraVe Hydrating Mineral Sunscreen SPF 30 Face Sheer Tint", "EltaMD UV Skin Recovery Broad Spectrum SPF 50", "First Aid Beauty Weightless Liquid Mineral Sunscreen with Zinc Oxide SPF 30", "Hero Cosmetics Force Shield Superlight Sunscreen SPF 30", "Tower 28 SunnyDays Tinted SPF 30 Sunscreen Foundation"], "expected_document_ids": ["shoppingcomp:c1e2da34-f9b6-4709-b904-0cbc63a836a0:0", "shoppingcomp:c1e2da34-f9b6-4709-b904-0cbc63a836a0:1", "shoppingcomp:c1e2da34-f9b6-4709-b904-0cbc63a836a0:2", "shoppingcomp:c1e2da34-f9b6-4709-b904-0cbc63a836a0:3", "shoppingcomp:c1e2da34-f9b6-4709-b904-0cbc63a836a0:4"], "expected_chunk_ids": ["shoppingcomp:c1e2da34-f9b6-4709-b904-0cbc63a836a0:0:0c3a09d8-9219-4df3-b2b2-e9c5a21a05e1", "shoppingcomp:c1e2da34-f9b6-4709-b904-0cbc63a836a0:0:41cd7c7f-85ad-4e34-8654-1ebcb4f95586", "shoppingcomp:c1e2da34-f9b6-4709-b904-0cbc63a836a0:0:450dddec-3a81-40d9-ae53-e04c90579343", "shoppingcomp:c1e2da34-f9b6-4709-b904-0cbc63a836a0:0:734f4176-78fc-4049-b3e9-3ee84eccfecc", "shoppingcomp:c1e2da34-f9b6-4709-b904-0cbc63a836a0:0:d46b2e96-3a9e-42b8-a682-90d99bad6ec4", "shoppingcomp:c1e2da34-f9b6-4709-b904-0cbc63a836a0:1:0c3a09d8-9219-4df3-b2b2-e9c5a21a05e1", "shoppingcomp:c1e2da34-f9b6-4709-b904-0cbc63a836a0:1:41cd7c7f-85ad-4e34-8654-1ebcb4f95586", "shoppingcomp:c1e2da34-f9b6-4709-b904-0cbc63a836a0:1:450dddec-3a81-40d9-ae53-e04c90579343", "shoppingcomp:c1e2da34-f9b6-4709-b904-0cbc63a836a0:1:734f4176-78fc-4049-b3e9-3ee84eccfecc", "shoppingcomp:c1e2da34-f9b6-4709-b904-0cbc63a836a0:1:d46b2e96-3a9e-42b8-a682-90d99bad6ec4", "shoppingcomp:c1e2da34-f9b6-4709-b904-0cbc63a836a0:2:0c3a09d8-9219-4df3-b2b2-e9c5a21a05e1"