{"question_id": "e1e81125-c1d6-475b-a4de-24e1ac01c3c6", "question": "我正在为我的院子寻找一款合适的安防摄像头,但我的要求比较多。首先,我们这一片供电不太稳定,偶尔会停电,所以我需要一个即使在断电后也能继续工作、继续录像的摄像头,不能当摆设。其次,我的院子大门和车库入口有个夹角,我希望能用一个设备就把这两个地方都监控到,不想装两个。这个摄像头是装在户外的,所以必须能防水防雨。到了晚上,我希望它能提供彩色的夜视画面,而不是黑白的,这样看得更清楚。画质也很重要,至少要能让我看清院门口的人脸和包裹上的信息,并且我希望能直接通过手机跟快递员对话,让他把包裹放在指定位置。最后一点,我家用的是双频路由器,为了保证视频流的顺畅,我希望摄像头能支持连接5G WiFi。你能根据这些需求给我一些建议吗?", "expected_product_names": ["Reolink Argus 4", "Reolink Argus 4 Pro", "Reolink Duo 2 (Battery)"], "expected_document_ids": ["shoppingcomp:e1e81125-c1d6-475b-a4de-24e1ac01c3c6:0", "shoppingcomp:e1e81125-c1d6-475b-a4de-24e1ac01c3c6:1", "shoppingcomp:e1e81125-c1d6-475b-a4de-24e1ac01c3c6:2"], "expected_chunk_ids": ["shoppingcomp:e1e81125-c1d6-475b-a4de-24e1ac01c3c6:0:1b781f36-e2c4-4655-9251-89f98629d6cb", "shoppingcomp:e1e81125-c1d6-475b-a4de-24e1ac01c3c6:0:3fb8b7f3-d021-457b-a8cb-010de0183792", "shoppingcomp:e1e81125-c1d6-475b-a4de-24e1ac01c3c6:0:478368bf-5d6b-45e7-9b57-721e3bcea60f", "shoppingcomp:e1e81125-c1d6-475b-a4de-24e1ac01c3c6:0:49412f58-b493-42ef-b573-1ebf4d9a9cfb", "shoppingcomp:e1e81125-c1d6-475b-a4de-24e1ac01c3c6:0:a68eed0d-91ec-4f1d-8fe7-f3a5ca7c99d0", "shoppingcomp:e1e81125-c1d6-475b-a4de-24e1ac01c3c6:0:c5599522-4c13-4113-92cd-2684215957b1", "shoppingcomp:e1e81125-c1d6-475b-a4de-24e1ac01c3c6:1:1b781f36-e2c4-4655-9251-89f98629d6cb", "shoppingcomp:e1e81125-c1d6-475b-a4de-24e1ac01c3c6:1:3fb8b7f3-d021-457b-a8cb-010de0183792", "shoppingcomp:e1e81125-c1d6-475b-a4de-24e1ac01c3c6:1:478368bf-5d6b-45e7-9b57-721e3bcea60f", "shoppingcomp:e1e81125-c1d6-475b-a4de-24e1ac01c3c6:1:49412f58-b493-42ef-b573-1ebf4d9a9cfb", "shoppingcomp:e1e81125-c1d6-475b-a4de-24e1ac01c3c6:1:a68eed0d-91ec-4f1d-8fe7-f3a5ca7c99d0", "shoppingcomp:e1e81125-c1d6-475b-a4de-24e1ac01c3c6:1:c5599522-4c13-4113-92cd-2684215957b1", "shoppingcomp:e1e81125-c1d6-475b-a4de-24e1ac01c3c6:2:1b781f36-e2c4-4655-9251-89f98629d6cb", "shoppingcomp:e1e81125-c1d6-475b-a4de-24e1ac01c3c6:2:3fb8b7f3-d021-457b-a8cb-010de0183792", "shoppingcomp:e1e