{"question_id": "fd2b165f-6cef-4bf6-adfd-568457eb594f", "question": "我在找一款新的清洁产品来应对我比较棘手的皮肤问题。我是混合性肤质,主要有两个困扰:脸部和背部仍会偶尔长痘、毛孔堵塞;脸颊和肩膀上还有旧痘痘留下的顽固暗斑。我以前用过一些力度较强的祛痘产品,但它们总让皮肤感觉不舒服、干燥、易刺激。我希望能找到一款可以同时用于面部和身体、简化护理步骤的单品。它需要既能有效淡化这些印记并帮助保持肌肤清透,又足够温和,不会过度清洁或损伤皮肤屏障。有什么建议吗?", "expected_product_names": ["CeraVe Acne Control Cleanser 痤疮控制洁面产品", "CeraVe Renewing SA Cleanser"], "expected_document_ids": ["shoppingcomp:fd2b165f-6cef-4bf6-adfd-568457eb594f:0", "shoppingcomp:fd2b165f-6cef-4bf6-adfd-568457eb594f:1"], "expected_chunk_ids": ["shoppingcomp:fd2b165f-6cef-4bf6-adfd-568457eb594f:0:13b486aa-70e6-4005-86ff-dd14c574e428", "shoppingcomp:fd2b165f-6cef-4bf6-adfd-568457eb594f:0:5c1da606-79a5-4554-a753-05dc66be3e3d", "shoppingcomp:fd2b165f-6cef-4bf6-adfd-568457eb594f:0:5d6944c7-49bf-4457-b41a-9485af27ac48", "shoppingcomp:fd2b165f-6cef-4bf6-adfd-568457eb594f:0:7f614354-6b23-48a3-bea6-aa5d5c5bc2c3", "shoppingcomp:fd2b165f-6cef-4bf6-adfd-568457eb594f:0:c0c44829-b63e-49b6-96f0-402f6f2ffddd", "shoppingcomp:fd2b165f-6cef-4bf6-adfd-568457eb594f:0:d9fec112-43a4-4b99-afb3-2a6181e5679c", "shoppingcomp:fd2b165f-6cef-4bf6-adfd-568457eb594f:0:e1798388-8efe-4343-bea4-bd7f6643805e", "shoppingcomp:fd2b165f-6cef-4bf6-adfd-568457eb594f:1:13b486aa-70e6-4005-86ff-dd14c574e428", "shoppingcomp:fd2b165f-6cef-4bf6-adfd-568457eb594f:1:5c1da606-79a5-4554-a753-05dc66be3e3d", "shoppingcomp:fd2b165f-6cef-4bf6-adfd-568457eb594f:1:5d6944c7-49bf-4457-b41a-9485af27ac48", "shoppingcomp:fd2b165f-6cef-4bf6-adfd-568457eb594f:1:7f614354-6b23-48a3-bea6-aa5d5c5bc2c3", "shoppingcomp:fd2b165f-6cef-4bf6-adfd-568457eb594f:1:c0c44829-b63e-49b6-96f0-402f6f2ffddd", "shoppingcomp:fd2b165f-6cef-4bf6-adfd-568457eb594f:1:d9fec112-43a4-4b99-afb3-2a6181e5679c", "shoppingcomp:fd2b165f-6cef-4bf6-adfd-568457eb594f:1:e1798388-8efe-4343-bea4-bd7f6643805e"], "expected_scene_ids": ["13b486aa-70e6-4005-86ff-dd14c574e428", "5c1da606-79a5-4554-a753-05dc66be3e3d", "5d6944c7-49bf-4457-b41a-9485af27ac48", "7f614354-6b23-48a3-bea6-aa5d5c5bc2c3", "c