{"question_id": "fa15c30b-d7cb-4d53-85bb-8b36bc7b039e", "question": "我在找一款去黑头的产品,但我的肤质比较棘手。我是混合性皮肤,T 区非常油,容易堆积顽固且深层的黑头;而脸颊则偏干且更敏感。我需要一款功效足够强的产品,能够深入鼻子和下巴的毛孔,把里面的油脂和脏东西都带出来。不过我担心撕拉型面膜的刺激性;我想避免使用过于疼痛、会让敏感的脸颊泛红受刺激的东西。最后,我不希望清洁后留下粗大的毛孔,以及被过度清洁导致的干燥紧绷感。我需要的产品不仅能有效去黑头,还要含有舒缓和保湿的成分,并且在清洁后帮助收敛、淡化毛孔的可见度。你有什么推荐?", "expected_product_names": ["COSRX BHA Blackhead Power Liquid", "Hero Cosmetics Pore Release Exfoliating BHA Toner"], "expected_document_ids": ["shoppingcomp:fa15c30b-d7cb-4d53-85bb-8b36bc7b039e:0", "shoppingcomp:fa15c30b-d7cb-4d53-85bb-8b36bc7b039e:1"], "expected_chunk_ids": ["shoppingcomp:fa15c30b-d7cb-4d53-85bb-8b36bc7b039e:0:176dfe6b-f594-4cba-8ca2-e51457b305fe", "shoppingcomp:fa15c30b-d7cb-4d53-85bb-8b36bc7b039e:0:3cf69d10-1d1e-4bf1-a6bd-1e7726716fb8", "shoppingcomp:fa15c30b-d7cb-4d53-85bb-8b36bc7b039e:0:3ee9b01f-63e3-4604-a2af-acfc86329669", "shoppingcomp:fa15c30b-d7cb-4d53-85bb-8b36bc7b039e:0:b59b0fbd-edeb-4ca1-9127-0904b011feb5", "shoppingcomp:fa15c30b-d7cb-4d53-85bb-8b36bc7b039e:0:b746b5e2-7e5f-445f-a8ec-5a33405868c5", "shoppingcomp:fa15c30b-d7cb-4d53-85bb-8b36bc7b039e:0:b955e172-ba16-474d-ba39-e7a307bab16f", "shoppingcomp:fa15c30b-d7cb-4d53-85bb-8b36bc7b039e:1:176dfe6b-f594-4cba-8ca2-e51457b305fe", "shoppingcomp:fa15c30b-d7cb-4d53-85bb-8b36bc7b039e:1:3cf69d10-1d1e-4bf1-a6bd-1e7726716fb8", "shoppingcomp:fa15c30b-d7cb-4d53-85bb-8b36bc7b039e:1:3ee9b01f-63e3-4604-a2af-acfc86329669", "shoppingcomp:fa15c30b-d7cb-4d53-85bb-8b36bc7b039e:1:b59b0fbd-edeb-4ca1-9127-0904b011feb5", "shoppingcomp:fa15c30b-d7cb-4d53-85bb-8b36bc7b039e:1:b746b5e2-7e5f-445f-a8ec-5a33405868c5", "shoppingcomp:fa15c30b-d7cb-4d53-85bb-8b36bc7b039e:1:b955e172-ba16-474d-ba39-e7a307bab16f"], "expected_scene_ids": ["176dfe6b-f594-4cba-8ca2-e51457b305fe", "3cf69d10-1d1e-4bf1-a6bd-1e7726716fb8", "3ee9b01f-63e3-4604-a2af-acfc86329669", "b59b0fbd-edeb-4ca1-9127-0904b011feb5", "b746b5e2-7e5f-445f-a8ec-5a33405868c5", "b955e172-ba16-474d-ba39-e7a307bab16f"], "source_type": "Synthesized User Questions", "ta