{"question_id": "6fb5a285-fe43-418d-a3d4-5a871da67963", "question": "我这空间比较小,然后我想要个网络摄像头。想要它放在一臂左右距离声音清楚不发闷、画面清晰流畅,我的首要考虑是直播时学生能清楚地看到我,在不同体式之间移动时也不能失焦。我这有一扇大窗户,一整天屋子里的光线都在变,别给我拍的到时候截出来的视频封面感官太不统一。除了直播课程,我还想为社交媒体制作宣传短片,所以得能切换适合手机的竖屏格式的录制。我没学过剪辑,没有多余钱买软件,最好摄像头是配简单好上手剪辑工具的,能直接给直播课加标题。还有,我是在家里拍,需要有实体的镜头盖,你推荐一下。", "expected_product_names": ["Logitech BRIO C1000s 4K 网络摄像头"], "expected_document_ids": ["shoppingcomp:6fb5a285-fe43-418d-a3d4-5a871da67963:0"], "expected_chunk_ids": ["shoppingcomp:6fb5a285-fe43-418d-a3d4-5a871da67963:0:2d55541c-7b2c-49af-a2dc-7788a3b5a12b", "shoppingcomp:6fb5a285-fe43-418d-a3d4-5a871da67963:0:43c72616-ba89-4e74-8f53-0edde1c3df7d", "shoppingcomp:6fb5a285-fe43-418d-a3d4-5a871da67963:0:6230fbf9-ccf4-470f-a0b5-7e8d42daf94d", "shoppingcomp:6fb5a285-fe43-418d-a3d4-5a871da67963:0:7885aa31-4b9a-4d10-a65b-21981b39ed63", "shoppingcomp:6fb5a285-fe43-418d-a3d4-5a871da67963:0:b63eca56-3efc-4b69-a62d-6137151d1e5a", "shoppingcomp:6fb5a285-fe43-418d-a3d4-5a871da67963:0:e0d0c372-88a9-4336-9869-f4d8954c9d83"], "expected_scene_ids": ["2d55541c-7b2c-49af-a2dc-7788a3b5a12b", "43c72616-ba89-4e74-8f53-0edde1c3df7d", "6230fbf9-ccf4-470f-a0b5-7e8d42daf94d", "7885aa31-4b9a-4d10-a65b-21981b39ed63", "b63eca56-3efc-4b69-a62d-6137151d1e5a", "e0d0c372-88a9-4336-9869-f4d8954c9d83"], "source_type": "Synthesized User Questions", "task_type": "ecommerce_product_selection", "answerable": true, "dataset": "ShoppingComp", "language": "zh", "license": "MIT"}
{"question_id": "acec324e-bda6-48e1-948f-72481ab407b6", "question": "我们家准备迎接第一个宝宝,所以想买个消毒柜,要求比较苛刻。最重要的一点是,家里有乙肝携带者,我特别担心病毒会通过餐具传染给宝宝,所以消毒柜必须能彻底杀灭乙肝病毒,要有权威认证的那种。另外,我有很多宝宝的奶瓶、安抚奶嘴这些,都是不耐高温的塑料或硅胶材质,不能跟我们大人的不锈钢碗筷一起用100多度的高温去煮,所以得有一个专门的、温和一点的消毒空间。而且,消毒完的碗筷必须是完全干的,不能湿漉漉地拿出来,不然感觉还是会滋生细菌。能帮我找一款满足这些所有要求的消毒柜吗?", "expected_product_names": ["海尔 ZQD110F-EB031 110升嵌入式光波巴氏消毒柜", "美的消毒柜110YQ2", "老板母婴级消毒柜XG832"], "expected_document_ids": ["shoppingcomp:acec324e-bda6-48e1-948f-72481ab407b6:0", "shoppingcomp:acec324e-bda6-48e1-948f-72481ab407b6:1", "shoppingcomp:acec324e-bda6-48e1-948f-72481ab407b6:2"], "expected_chunk_ids": ["shoppingcomp:acec324e-bda6-48e1-948f-72481ab407b6:0:6ca6c06f-4b08-4490-85db-e83f38562535", "shoppingcomp:acec324e-bda6-48e1-948f-72481ab407b6:0:8b7513f5-162a-412d-bc50-77c5e5d0b732", "shoppingcomp:acec324e-bda6-48e1-948f-72481ab407b6:0:a88997c1-b831-4ab0-aaf1-532a1ac32353", "shoppingcomp:acec324e-bda6-48e1-948f-72481ab407b6:1:6ca6c06f-4b08-4490-85db-e83f38562535", "shoppingcomp:acec324e-bda6-48e1-948f-72481ab407b6:1:8b7513f5-162a-412d-bc50-77c5e5d0b732", "shoppingcomp:acec324e-bda6-48e1-948f-72481ab407b6:1:a88997c1-b831-4ab0-aaf1-532a1ac32353", "shoppingcomp:acec324e-bda6-48e1-948f-72481ab407b6:2:6ca6c06f-4b08-4490-85db-e83f38562535", "shoppingcomp:acec324e-bda6-48e1-948f-72481ab407b6:2:8b7513f5-162a-412d-bc50-77c5e5d0b732", "shoppingcomp:acec324e-bda6-48e1-948f-72481ab407b6:2:a88997c1-b831-4ab0-aaf1-532a1ac32353"], "expected_scene_ids": ["6ca6c06f-4b08-4490-85db-e83f38562535", "8b7513f5-162a-412d-bc50-77c5e5d0b732", "a88997c1-b831-4ab0-aaf1-532a1ac32353"], "source_type": "Expert Questions", "task_type": "ecommerce_product_selection", "answerable": true, "dataset": "ShoppingComp", "language": "zh", "license": "MIT"}
{"question_id": "b3c113d3-981a-457e-844c-d95e169c30c2", "question": "最近开始学滑雪了,第一次就摔疼尾椎,骨头没事但吓坏了,我看半天都没找到同时防疼防骨折的,我后面租了个通用的护具感觉不是给女生设计的,护垫又细又硬,4 小时内我总共摔了 5 次,我的屁股简直废了。已经过去 5 天了,我还是很疼。说实话,这个护垫既救了我,又伤了我。虽然我觉得它在防止摔倒时保护臀部方面做得不错,但在滑雪第三天之后,坐着就不太舒服了,因为衬垫太硬了。我想要的是在雪地上系滑雪板时坐着更舒服的东西,摔倒时保能护骨骼的内穿护具,我就是很脆弱,又怕疼又怕骨折,还不想穿得像卡戴珊,帮我找找有适合我用的吗?", "expected_product_names": ["Demon Flexforce X D3O/XRD Women’s Impact Shorts", "XION Freeride Evo D3O Women’s Impact Shorts"], "expected_document_ids": ["shoppingcomp:b3c113d3-981a-457e-844c-d95e169c30c2:0", "shoppingcomp:b3c113d3-981a-457e-844c-d95e169c30c2:1"], "expected_chunk_ids": ["shoppingcomp:b3c113d3-981a-457e-844c-d95e169c30c2:0:3cbbfb3c-5ff7-4119-b487-7184ce9f8c5c", "shoppingcomp:b3c113d3-981a-457e-844c-d95e169c30c2:0:3d44cbf4-a549-4d29-a568-49cca5fac89b", "shoppingcomp:b3c113d3-981a-457e-844c-d95e169c30c2:0:4a00e85f-8e2b-4a8f-8dd7-7c5d8ec81271", "shoppingcomp:b3c113d3-981a-457e-844c-d95e169c30c2:0:874d97cf-9a89-4e97-a814-67484783037b", "shoppingcomp:b3c113d3-981a-457e-844c-d95e169c30c2:0:ab09f776-a278-44ba-bf5f-305b9b3b7630", "shoppingcomp:b3c113d3-981a-457e-844c-d95e169c30c2:1:3cbbfb3c-5ff7-4119-b487-7184ce9f8c5c", "shoppingcomp:b3c113d3-981a-457e-844c-d95e169c30c2:1:3d44cbf4-a549-4d29-a568-49cca5fac89b", "shoppingcomp:b3c113d3-981a-457e-844c-d95e169c30c2:1:4a00e85f-8e2b-4a8f-8dd7-7c5d8ec81271", "shoppingcomp:b3c113d3-981a-457e-844c-d95e169c30c2:1:874d97cf-9a89-4e97-a814-67484783037b", "shoppingcomp:b3c113d3-981a-457e-844c-d95e169c30c2:1:ab09f776-a278-44ba-bf5f-305b9b3b7630"], "expected_scene_ids": ["3cbbfb3c-5ff7-4119-b487-7184ce9f8c5c", "3d44cbf4-a549-4d29-a568-49cca5fac89b", "4a00e85f-8e2b-4a8f-8dd7-7c5d8ec81271", "874d97cf-9a89-4e97-a814-67484783037b", "ab09f776-a278-44ba-bf5f-305b9b3b7630"], "source_type": "Expert Questions", "task_type": "ecommerce_product_selection", "answerable": true, "dataset": "ShoppingComp", "language": "zh", "license": "MIT"}
